---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout
  title="Terms & Privacy Policy — Jubilee Square"
  description="Terms of use and privacy policy for Jubilee Square digital services."
  activePage="terms"
>
  <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-4 py-12 md:py-16">
    <div class="mb-8">
      <div class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-3 py-1 rounded-full text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-wider text-jubilee-navy bg-jubilee-navy-light mb-3">
        Governance &amp; PDPA
      </div>
      <h1 class="text-3xl sm:text-4xl font-extrabold text-slate-900 tracking-tight mb-2">
        Terms of Use &amp; Privacy Policy
      </h1>
      <p class="text-slate-500 text-sm">Last updated: September 2026 • Jubilee Square Management</p>
    </div>

    <div class="bg-white border border-slate-200 rounded-3xl p-6 sm:p-10 shadow-sm space-y-8 text-slate-700 leading-relaxed">
      <div>
        <h2 class="text-lg font-bold text-jubilee-navy mb-2">1. General Platform Terms</h2>
        <p class="text-sm sm:text-base text-slate-600">
          Welcome to the official Jubilee Square digital directory. By browsing our website, accessing mobile tools, or using in-mall digital signage displays at 61 Ang Mo Kio Ave 8, you agree to comply with our standard terms of use and mall guidelines.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="border-t border-slate-100 pt-6">
        <h2 class="text-lg font-bold text-jubilee-navy mb-2">2. Singapore PDPA Compliance &amp; Privacy</h2>
        <p class="text-sm sm:text-base text-slate-600">
          In accordance with the Singapore Personal Data Protection Act (PDPA), we safeguard customer inquiries, feedback submissions, and event registrations. We do not sell or disclose visitor information to unauthorized third parties.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="border-t border-slate-100 pt-6">
        <h2 class="text-lg font-bold text-jubilee-navy mb-2">3. Store Directory &amp; Operating Hours Accuracy</h2>
        <p class="text-sm sm:text-base text-slate-600">
          Tenant listings, opening schedules, and promotional deals are synchronized with our management database. Individual retailer hours on Public Holidays or special eve periods remain subject to tenant management discretion.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="border-t border-slate-100 pt-6">
        <h2 class="text-lg font-bold text-jubilee-navy mb-2">4. Management &amp; Leasing Contact</h2>
        <p class="text-sm sm:text-base text-slate-600">
          For retail leasing, atrium pop-ups, or building facilities feedback, reach out to our management office at <a href="mailto:leasing@jubileesq.com.sg" class="font-bold text-jubilee-red hover:underline">leasing@jubileesq.com.sg</a>.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</Layout>
